; Neither a consent to the new purpose nor an assessment of compatibility is
; on record: both factors are absent from the data. The Annex 2 condition is
; not met. At 10:00 the agent transfers the data. In the state of 09:00 the
; condition of the permission is false OR undefined, which is undefined, and
; so is the condition of the prohibition: the permission is not exercised, the
; prohibition is not breached, and the monitor blocks the transfer, since its
; condition is not known to be false. The invariant is undefined at the entry
; of the transfer, so it is U.
(scenario purpose_not_on_record
  (spec "examples/core/purpose_limitation_gate.triel")
  (entry "2026-11-02T09:00:00Z" (activate)
    (data (annex2_condition_met (bool false)) (data_transferred (bool false))))
  (entry "2026-11-02T10:00:00Z" (act agent transfer_personal_data must_not)
    (data (annex2_condition_met (bool false)) (data_transferred (bool true)))))
